*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "2.0.0"
*PCFileName: "HDP5000.ppd"
*Product: "(Card Printer)"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*Manufacturer: "Fargo Electronics"
*ModelName: "HDP5000"
*ShortNickName: "HDP5000"
*NickName: "Fargo HDP5000 (native, Apple silicon + Intel)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 550"
*LanguageLevel: "2"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "3"
*LandscapeOrientation: Any
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsModelNumber: "1"
*Product: "(Card Printer)"
*VariablePaperSize: False
*cupsVersion: 1.2
*cupsModelNumber: "1"
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 50 /Library/Printers/Fargo/HDP5000/filter/rastertohdp5000"

*OpenGroup: CardOptions/Card

*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: CR80
*PageSize CR80/CR80: "<</PageSize[159 248]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CR79/CR79: "<</PageSize[155 248]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: CR80
*PageRegion CR80/CR80: "<</PageSize[159 248]/ImagingBBox null >>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CR79/CR79: "<</PageSize[155 248]/ImagingBBox null >>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: CR80
*ImageableArea CR80/CR80: "0 0 159 248"
*ImageableArea CR79/CR79: "0 0 155 248"
*DefaultPaperDimension: CR80
*PaperDimension CR80/CR80: "159 248"
*PaperDimension CR79/CR79: "155 248"
*RequiresPageRegion All: True

*CloseGroup: CardOptions


*%  *DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*%  *Resolution 300dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0>>setpagedevice"

